"Shows: which module defines the model, which modules extend it (runtime MRO order),\n"
"field counts and custom fields, all views with their inheritance, window actions,\n"
"and methods overridden across modules.\n"
"\n"
"Use when the user asks things like: \"which modules modify sale.order?\",\n"
"\"where is this model defined?\", \"what views does this model have?\",\n"
"\"which methods are overridden?\".\n"
"\n"
"Requires the code graph index to be built (AI Studio > Code Graph > Rebuild Index)."
msgstr ""

